      "trackName": "Wrist Paper Scissors",
      "description": "The watch is your rock-paper-scissors hand. Tap and it throws for you after a proper 3-2-1 haptic countdown, so you and your opponent go on the same beat. No hand signs, no waiting to cheat, works with gloves on.\n\n- Throw for me: show your wrist instead of throwing a hand\n- Play the watch: a best-of-three against the watch itself\n- A 3-2-1 haptic countdown that actually lands\n- Variants beyond the classic: Lizard-Spock, Snake-Water-Gun, Bear-Hunter-Ninja, and big balanced sets up to RPS-101, all free\n- A watch-face complication, one tap to throw\n\nNo account, no ads, no tracking. Just settle it.",
